  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mongolia - Made in Mongolia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Made in Mongolia BV is a young company, which has invested in a sustainable production of horse-hair &amp; -leather in Darkhan, Mongolia. The company has trained Mongolian herders-cooperatives in quality raw materials quality manage-ment, traceability, and grass-fed standards. The cooperatives are ready to put the obtained knowledge into service- and the company is able to connect this to a market in The Netherlands. With this loan we intend to pre-finance a stock supply otherwise impossible for us to purchase. With this delivering the company both built trust at the side of the customer/ future (customer)- investors and consolidate our sourcing network.</narrative>
  </description>
